{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38954","headline":"投郑先辈 · 杜荀鹤","name":"投郑先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匣中长劒未酬恩，不遇男儿不合论。\n闷向酒杯吞日月，闲将诗句问乾坤。\n宁辞马足劳关路，肯爲渔竿忆水村。\n两鬓欲斑三百首，更教装写傍谁门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}